# Markdown is authored, not generated.
#
# Prettier preserves prose (`proseWrap: "preserve"`) but re-pads every cell of
# every table to the widest row. Adding one row then rewrites every other row,
# so a one-line change arrives as a fifty-line diff — the exact fake-diff
# problem formatting is supposed to remove. The docs here are hand-wrapped and
# reviewed as prose; they are not better for being machine-aligned.
*.md
.qa/
